      "text": [
        "ه عن الحسن بن عليّ الكوفيّ فقد رويته عن أبي- رحمه اللّه- عن عليّ بن الحسن بن عليّ الكوفيّ، عن أبيه. و رويته عن جعفر بن عليّ بن الحسن الكوفيّ، عن جدّه الحسن بن عليّ الكوفيّ‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Al-Hasan ibn Ali Al-Kufi has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) have mercy on him - from Ali ibn Al-Hasan ibn Ali Al-Kufi, from his father.\nI have also narrated it from Ja'far ibn Ali ibn Al-Hasan Al-Kufi, from his grandfather Al-Hasan ibn Ali Al-Kufi."
        ]
      }
